---
layout: layout.njk
permalink: /officers.html
title: "Michigan AIAA: About Us"
pageKey: about
css: /assets-about/officers.css
bodyClass: homepage subpage page-about
navCurrent: about
eleventyComputed:
  heroImageUrl: "{{ about.heroImage | safe }}"
---
<div id="main-wrapper">
                    <div class="wrapper style2">
                        <div class="inner">
                            <div class="container">
                                <div id="content">

                                    <!-- Content -->

                                        <article>
{{ about.introHtml | safe }}
</article>

                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="wrapper style3">
                        <div class="inner">
                            <div class="container">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-8 col-12-medium">

                                        <!-- Article list -->
                                            <section class="box article-list">
                                                <h2 class="icon fa-file-text-o">{{ about.officersHeading }}</h2>

                                                {% for o in about.officers %}
													<article class="box excerpt">
														<a href="#" class="image left"><img src="{{ o.photo }}" alt="{{ o.name }}"></a>
														<div>
															<header>
																<span class="date">{{ o.name }}</span>
																<h3><a href="#">{{ o.role }}</a></h3>
															</header>
															<p>{{ o.bio }}</p>
														</div>
													</article>
													{% endfor %}
											</section>
									</div>
									<div class="col-4 col-12-medium">

                                        <!-- MEMBER SPOTLIGHT -->
                                            <section class="box spotlight">
                                                <h2 class="icon fa-file-text-o">{{ about.spotlightHeading }}</h2>
												<article>
													<a href="#" class="image featured"><img src="{{ about.spotlightImage }}" alt=""></a>
													<header>
														<h3><a href="#">{{ about.spotlightName }}</a></h3>
														<p>{{ about.spotlightDate }}</p>
													</header>
													{% for line in about.spotlightText %}<p>{{ line }}</p>{% endfor %}
												</article>
											</section>
                                        <!-- END EDITABLE SECTION -->
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            